    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7478" root="حذو" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذْوَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A gift;</i> (K, and Ham p. 596;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَيَّا</span></b> ; (TA;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذْيَا</span>: (Mgh, and Ham ubi
suprà:) or <i>a portion that is given of spoil.</i> (S.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذْيَا</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حذى</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A piece,</i>
(K,) or <i>small piece,</i> (TA,) <i>of flesh-meat:</i> (K,
TA:) or <i>a piece of flesh cut lengthwise;</i> or so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذْيَةٌ</span>, accord. to some. (Mgh.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذْيَةٌ</span>,
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حذى</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذَآءٌ</span>, in three places.

